## Scope honesty and cleanup receipt

- No real tray click, Scheduled Task state, live Ack, VB-CABLE delivery, or LAN audio/network claim is made. Those behaviors are deferred to later Wave 5/deployment acceptance tasks.
- Restart does not call Stop; Exit is the only path that stops and exits this process run. No service, tray IPC, extra menu capability, fallback endpoint, or workspace crate was added.
